#: ../../tools/lotus_tools.rst:63 f2b63d032b214ef39cd7cd189f43def5
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the LOTUS natural products database specifically "
"by InChIKey, which provides exact structural matching. InChIKey is a "
"27-character hash that uniquely identifies a chemical structure. This is "
"the most precise way to look up a natural product in LOTUS. Returns the "
"same results as LOTUS\\_search\\_natural\\_products but is optimized for "
"InChIKey lookups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/lotus_tools.rst:67 66f5c0765cda44e8958bdb5075ac43cb
msgid ""
"``inchikey`` (string) (required) InChIKey to search for (e.g., "
"'RYYVLZVUVIJVGH-UHFFFAOYSA-N' for caffeine, 'IQBMWEYFKNVACH-MEBVLIOMSA-N'"
" for quercetin)"
msgstr ""

